                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump\u2019s cuts are a burden that the Hudson Valley simply can\u2019t afford.\n\nIt impacts us all \u2013 kicking hard working folks off their health care, raising costs, and closing hospitals & clinics.\n\nToday I proudly stood with healthcare leaders & workers on the frontline of this battle. https://t.co/FxF4gLr37f",
