                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Bring back the local, independent doctors offices & pharmacies who care for you \u2013 not United\u2019s earnings report.\n\nBring down the price of your care.\n\nBreak down the endless roadblocks.\n\nPass my Patients Over Profits Act.",
