                "text": "We\u2019re already feeling the harms of Trump\u2019s devastating health care cuts in the Hudson Valley.\n\nPeople are losing coverage. Costs are skyrocketing. Hospitals are cutting services.\n\nThese are burdens our community simply cannot afford. https://t.co/rlc69U8TaA",
