                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We already have 17,000 of our neighbors \u2013 veterans, single parents, disabled people \u2013 receiving letters in the mail that they will lose coverage entirely.\n\nIt is completely wrong and deeply un-American.\n\nI won\u2019t stop fighting for a more affordable Hudson Valley: \n\nhttps://t.co/lp7r18SIfQ",
