                "text": "Medicare open enrollment runs through December 7.\n\nJust like my team helped Deborah, we're here to help you navigate the process & get the coverage that's right for you, too. Please reach out at 845-443-2930 or at https://t.co/bz3zJoYMc7. https://t.co/8fSqAPBAoq",
